debug('begin add_signature: PROFILE_SHARE_PARTITION');
   l_info('##SHOW_SQL##'):= 'Y';
  add_signature(
      p_sig_repo_id            => '5130',
      p_sig_id                 => 'PROFILE_SHARE_PARTITION',
      p_sig_sql                => 'SELECT /* PROFILE_SHARE_PARTITION */ FND_PROFILE.VALUE(''MSC_SHARE_PARTITIONS'') SHARE_PLAN_PARTITION FROM DUAL
WHERE FND_PROFILE.VALUE(''MSC_SHARE_PARTITIONS'') = ''Y''',
      p_title                  => 'MSC: Share Plan Partitions Profile Option Setting',
      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => '<span style="color: crimson; font-weight:bold;">The MSC: Share Plan Partitions Profile Option is set to Yes</span>',
      p_solution               => 'This profile option <u>MUST ALWAYS</u> be set to "No" <BR>
<BR>
The process of converting to plan partitions involves more steps than just setting the profile to "No".  <BR>
<BR>
Follow the detailed steps provided in: <BR>
<BR>
<i>[2158166/KB220359] MSCANAPP: Analyze Plan Partition Errors ORA-20000 or MSCCRPAR: Create APS Partitions Errors ORA-02149 ORA-14074 or MSCSDW: Snapshot Delete Worker Errors ORA-02149</i><BR>
<BR>
Note that for any plan that has been purged yet the free_flag for the corresponding partition has not been updated to 1 (Free) in msc_plan_partitions, you should run Drop Partition request with that partition number and parameter Plan = Yes.
Then run Create APS partitions request with Plan partition = 1 and instance partition = 0 to replace this partition as required by the business. <BR>
<BR>
In addition, using ''MSC: Share Plan Partitions = Yes'' can cause performance issues and requires that you perform steps to convert to No before you perform any volume testing or go-live. The conversion requires purging all plans from the system. <BR>
<BR>
<i>References: <BR>
[1304299/KB407926] Purge Plan Is Not Setting Free_flag In Msc_plan_partitions. Plan create screen, error on save there is an error while getting plan id. no free partitions available<BR>
[137293/KB742426] How to Manage APS Partitions in the MSC Schema</i>',
