Refer to [1162585/KB787923] GLSTFL FLAT0002 and FLAT0003 Error In General Ledger Accounting Setup Program',
      p_success_msg            => 'OK! No issue found',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('ALWAYS','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('E','W'),
      p_print_sql_output       => nvl('RS','RS'),
