      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'Overlapping segment values exists. <br>
Only the first row is displayed in the output due to a maximum threshold defined. But, there could be more transactions having this problem.',
      p_solution               => 'Overlapping Child Accounts exist. 
<br>Refer to [118130/KB792049] and [371580/KB709486] for solution to fix any Ledger records having the problem.',
