      p_solution               => '<strong>Bug Number: </strong>15867522</br><strong>Note: </strong>[2179018/KB713368]</br><strong>Script Name: </strong>ap_inv_pmt_insert_sel.sql</br></br>Apply the root cause fix from bugs {15867522} and {11699958} if you have not done so, and follow the instructions in [2179018/KB713368] to log a Service Request to obtain the data fix. AFTER applying the data-fix follow the instructions in [1174813/KB738668] to apply the indicated GDF patch and complete the fix.</br></br><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> This fix will undo accounting.<br/><strong>NOTE:</strong>For transactions posted in <strong>closed periods</strong> the reversing and corrected events will be accounted <strong>in the current open period.</strong><br/>For a deeper understanding of the undo accounting process please refer to [753695/KB218158].</br>',
